  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.33 Educational training agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.33 “Educational training agency” means an agency based in NH which is approved by the division to conduct emergency medical services training programs, in accordance with the requirements set forth in Saf-C 5916.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
